# An unreleased game's page never lives in this repository. There is one block
# below per game whose `released` switch is off, listing everything that would
# become its page, and the whole block comes out on the day that switch goes
# on. `_games/<name>.md` is tracked either way: it holds only the banner words,
# which the home page already shows in public.

